#: ../../functions/func_right.rst:11
msgid "**Description:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../functions/func_right.rst:13
msgid "Returns the last ``number`` characters from ``text``. If ``number`` is less than 1, then the value used is the number of characters in ``text`` plus ``number`` (e.g.: ``$right(abcd,0)`` is the same as ``$right(abcd,4)``). If ``number`` is missing or a negative number greater than the number of characters in ``text``, the function will return an empty string."
msgstr ""

